    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Network World!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Nqc, you play as a data duplicate of a human named &quot;Tris.&quot; To return to the real world, you must complete various tasks within a virtual space\u2014a forgotten game full of NPCs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Across Dimensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through [Memory / Reality / A Game within a Game]: three different dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The network world around you breaks all boundaries, blending 2D and 3D seamlessly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/86c69bf9bdfb001ea7c81cdb2c3acdf7.avif?t=1754640247\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the [Chamber], interact with reality, replay forgotten memories, and <strong>DIVE\u00a0</strong>into the game as you move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/d0ac79fca99f11ebb562fafc1fdb501c.poster.avif?t=1754640247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/d0ac79fca99f11ebb562fafc1fdb501c.webm?t=1754640247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/d0ac79fca99f11ebb562fafc1fdb501c.mp4?t=1754640247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World of Rampant Consciousness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The abandoned game &quot;ANTAGONIST&quot; within the network is a world twisted by bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, the NPCs know they exist within a game and live with that awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, they don\u2019t seem so different from us. ((At least, not on the surface.))</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/07cdf2f9bd3029951f9c8b3641e42085.poster.avif?t=1754640247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/07cdf2f9bd3029951f9c8b3641e42085.webm?t=1754640247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/07cdf2f9bd3029951f9c8b3641e42085.mp4?t=1754640247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to them, and sometimes eliminate them to uncover the truth. ((Though, there\u2019s really no need to eliminate them... if you don\u2019t want to.))</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/09f46ef0813bb1413e6939b12608d63c.avif?t=1754640247\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Another Self Within Lost Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The [Chamber] has another feature: the Memory Camcorder, which lets you revisit forgotten memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look back at who you were in the past, in the real world, and hold on tight to the thread of your identity so you don\u2019t lose your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/40e7e4158a85395d9de171ada3c3e638.avif?t=1754640247\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Network World!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Nqc, you play as a data duplicate of a human named &quot;Tris.&quot; To return to the real world, you must complete various tasks within a virtual space\u2014a forgotten game full of NPCs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Across Dimensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through [Memory / Reality / A Game within a Game]: three different dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The network world around you breaks all boundaries, blending 2D and 3D seamlessly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/86c69bf9bdfb001ea7c81cdb2c3acdf7.avif?t=1754640247\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the [Chamber], interact with reality, replay forgotten memories, and <strong>DIVE\u00a0</strong>into the game as you move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/d0ac79fca99f11ebb562fafc1fdb501c.poster.avif?t=1754640247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/d0ac79fca99f11ebb562fafc1fdb501c.webm?t=1754640247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/d0ac79fca99f11ebb562fafc1fdb501c.mp4?t=1754640247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World of Rampant Consciousness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The abandoned game &quot;ANTAGONIST&quot; within the network is a world twisted by bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, the NPCs know they exist within a game and live with that awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, they don\u2019t seem so different from us. ((At least, not on the surface.))</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/07cdf2f9bd3029951f9c8b3641e42085.poster.avif?t=1754640247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/07cdf2f9bd3029951f9c8b3641e42085.webm?t=1754640247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/07cdf2f9bd3029951f9c8b3641e42085.mp4?t=1754640247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to them, and sometimes eliminate them to uncover the truth. ((Though, there\u2019s really no need to eliminate them... if you don\u2019t want to.))</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/09f46ef0813bb1413e6939b12608d63c.avif?t=1754640247\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Another Self Within Lost Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The [Chamber] has another feature: the Memory Camcorder, which lets you revisit forgotten memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look back at who you were in the past, in the real world, and hold on tight to the thread of your identity so you don\u2019t lose your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292780/extras/40e7e4158a85395d9de171ada3c3e638.avif?t=1754640247\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
